  "steps": [
    "Cook the bacon, then reserve the fat and crumble the bacon once cool.",
    "Season the chicken tenderloins with salt, pepper, onion powder and smoked paprika.",
    "Cook the chicken in the bacon fat over medium heat until cooked through, about 4 minutes per side. Rest, then slice.",
    "Whisk all the buffalo ranch ingredients together, adding hot sauce until it is as hot as you want it. Thin with a little water if it is too thick.",
    "Arrange the greens on a platter and lay the chicken, bacon, cucumber, tomato, egg and avocado over the top in rows.",
    "Drizzle with the buffalo ranch and finish with green onion."
